  data: {
    LLM: 'Players take turns playing one card to capture table cards that sum to exactly 15 with the played card. Captured cards and the playing card are taken and stored face-down. If no capture is possible, the card remains face-up on the table. Players cycle through their dealt cards, and new cards are dealt after all players have played their three cards. Play continues until the deck is exhausted.',
    Player: 'Players take turns playing one card to capture table cards that sum to exactly 15 with the played card. Captured cards and the playing card are taken and stored face-down. If no capture is possible, the card remains face-up on the table. Players cycle through their dealt cards, and new cards are dealt after all players have played their three cards. Play continues until the deck is exhausted.',
    objective: 'Be the first player or team to score 21 or more points by capturing cards that sum to exactly 15, collecting majority points in multiple categories, and earning bonus points for sweeps.',
    gameplay: 'Players take turns playing one card to capture table cards that sum to exactly 15 with the played card. Captured cards and the playing card are taken and stored face-down. If no capture is possible, the card remains face-up on the table. Players cycle through their dealt cards, and new cards are dealt after all players have played their three cards. Play continues until the deck is exhausted.',
    keyRules: [
      'Capture must sum to EXACTLY 15.',
      'Only after a complete table clear is an Escoba scored.',
      'Setenta (optional): Each player/team selects the highest card per suit summing to a maximum = best Setenta wins 1pt.',
    ],
